#. Description of the plugin
#: sev-structured-llms-txt.php
msgid "Generates a structured llms.txt at /llms.txt, listing pages, posts, and (if WooCommerce is active) products, grouped by category, so AI assistants and LLMs can discover your site's content. Works on single sites and WordPress Multisite, network-wide or per site."
msgstr ""

